OL,3,GNEWSARiver of Light 2026: Everything
OL,4,Ayou need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool will be transformed into a
OL,7,Fgiant illuminated gallery this autumn
OL,8,Fas the free River of Light festival
OL,9,Freturns to the city.
OL,11,FThe annual event will see a light
OL,12,Finstallation trail extend along the
OL,13,Fwaterfront and in the city centre from
OL,14,FFriday 23 October until Sunday 1
OL,15,FNovember.
OL,17,FThe festival's theme this year is
OL,18,F"Together", something which organisers
OL,19,Fsay is a celebration of "connection,
OL,20,Fcommunity and shared experiences".
OL,22,FThe 2026 festival features 13 artworks.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
